# Combat rulings (docs/flow.md, "Combat"): the rulebook's own worked examples and published rulings,
# replayed on the engine. Sources: the VEKN rulebook (vekn.net/rulebook: "First Strike", "Combat
# Ends", "Dodge", "Steal Blood", "Additional Strikes", "Damage Resolution", "Press", "End of Round")
# and zero-vtes docs/rules-qa.md (4.3, 47.2, 58.2, 63.4). Seating A B C: A's prey is B, its predator
# C. Gate Hound is an ally. Hunts are undirected: B, then C, may block.
seed 5
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
crypt A "Vera Nightfall" *12
library A "Iron Ward" *40
crypt B "Tomas Grey" *12
library B "Quick Feed" *40
crypt C "Ilse Várga" *12
library C "Gate Hound" *40
start

A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
C> move C:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> transfer +3 A:ready:1
A> next
A> next

# Rulebook "Combat Ends": always the first strike to resolve, even before a first strike, and no
# other strike lands (zero-vtes 63.4). "End of Round": the step still comes when combat ends early.
A> bleed A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
A> pass strikes
B> pass strikes
A> strike 3 first
B> strike ends
expect combat 1 end-of-round close
A> pass
B> pass
expect action none
expect card A:ready:1 blood 3
expect count B:torpor 0

# Rulebook "Dodge": a dodge protects even from a first strike (zero-vtes 58.2). Nothing lands, both
# stay ready, so the press step comes.
A> unlock A:ready:1
C> transfer +2 C:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> pass
C> block C:ready:1
A> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
C> pass strikes
A> strike 2 first
C> strike dodge
log public Round 1 · Damage: No strike lands
A> pass
C> pass
expect combat 1 press close
A> pass
C> pass
A> pass
C> pass
expect action none
expect card C:ready:1 blood 2

# Rulebook "First Strike": a minion sent to torpor by a first strike doesn't strike at all. With no
# blood, Tomas can't mend the point. An additional strike claimed then is lost: additional strikes
# need both combatants still ready (zero-vtes 47.2), and so does the press step.
A> unlock A:ready:1
B> unlock B:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
B> pass strikes
A> strike 1 first
B> strike 3
log public Round 1 · Damage: Tomas Grey is about to take 1 damage
A> strike extra
A> pass
B> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Tomas Grey takes 1 damage and goes to torpor
expect count B:torpor 1
expect combat 1 end-of-round close
A> pass
B> pass
expect action none
expect card A:ready:1 blood 3

# Rulebook "Aggravated damage", Nassir: 1 blood, 1 aggravated damage. It can't be mended: wounded,
# he goes to torpor with his 1 blood.
C> transfer -1 C:ready:1
A> unlock A:ready:1
C> unlock C:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> pass
C> block C:ready:1
A> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
C> pass strikes
A> strike 1A
C> strike none
A> pass
C> pass
expect count C:torpor 1
expect card C:torpor:1 blood 1
expect combat 1 end-of-round close
A> pass
C> pass
expect action none

# Tamoszius: 2 blood, 3 aggravated. Wounded by the first point, he burns a blood for each of the
# other two, and goes to torpor empty.
C> move C:uncontrolled:1 ready
C> transfer +2 C:ready:1
A> unlock A:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> pass
C> block C:ready:1
A> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
C> pass strikes
A> strike 3A
C> strike none
A> pass
C> pass
expect count C:torpor 2
expect card C:torpor:2 blood 0
expect combat 1 end-of-round close
A> pass
C> pass
expect action none

# Rulebook "Steal Blood", Chrysanthemum and the Underbridge Stray: the stolen blood comes before
# mending and drains off above capacity. Vera (capacity 7, 6 blood) steals the hound's 2 life and
# takes 1: 8 blood, 1 drained, 1 mended, 6 left. The hound has no life left and is burned.
A> transfer +3 A:ready:1
expect card A:ready:1 blood 6
C> play "Gate Hound" ready
C> life +2 C:ready:1
A> unlock A:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> pass
C> block C:ready:1
A> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
C> pass strikes
A> strike steal 2
C> strike hand
A> pass
C> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Vera Nightfall steals 2 life from Gate Hound; 1 drains off, over capacity
expect card A:ready:1 blood 6
expect count C:ready 0
expect count C:ashHeap 1
expect combat 1 end-of-round close
A> pass
C> pass
expect action none

# Rulebook "Additional Strikes", Wauneka and Flávio Gonçalves: a 4-damage strike dodged; Wauneka
# gains 1 additional strike, Flávio 2. Both hand-strike (1 damage each); then Flávio strikes once
# more, alone.
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
B> transfer +4 B:ready:1
A> unlock A:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
B> pass strikes
A> strike 4
B> strike dodge
A> strike extra
A> pass
B> strike extra
A> pass
B> pass
log public Additional strikes: Vera Nightfall and Tomas Grey
A> strike hand
B> strike hand
A> pass
B> strike extra
A> pass
B> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Vera Nightfall takes 1 damage and mends it (1 blood)
log public Round 1 · Damage: Tomas Grey takes 1 damage and mends it (1 blood)
log public Additional strikes: Tomas Grey
reject A> strike hand
B> strike hand
A> pass
B> pass
expect card A:ready:1 blood 4
expect card B:ready:1 blood 3
expect combat 1 press close
A> pass
B> pass
A> pass
B> pass
expect action none

# Rulebook "Determine Range" and zero-vtes 4.3: at long range a hand strike is still legal, and does
# nothing; a ranged strike lands.
A> unlock A:ready:1
B> unlock B:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
C> pass
A> pass
B> pass
A> maneuver long via A:hand:1
expect impulse A
A> pass
B> pass
A> pass
B> pass
expect combat 1 strikes long
A> strike hand
B> strike 2R
log public Round 1 · Damage: Vera Nightfall is about to take 2 damage
A> pass
B> pass
expect card A:ready:1 blood 2
expect card B:ready:1 blood 3
expect combat 1 press long
A> pass
B> pass
expect combat 1 end-of-round long
A> pass
B> pass
expect action none

# Rulebook "Steal Blood": the ally with no life counters left is burned, with no damage done to it.
C> play C:hand:1 ready
C> life +1 C:ready:1
A> unlock A:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> pass
C> block C:ready:1
A> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
C> pass strikes
A> strike steal 1
C> strike none
A> pass
C> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Vera Nightfall steals 1 life from Gate Hound
log public Round 1 · Damage: Gate Hound has no life left and is burned
expect card A:ready:1 blood 3
expect count C:ashHeap 2
